  "contract": [
    "Issue #9132. The PR author's ruling (2026-11-25): no Criminal: Blood On Your Hands 9930873 is applied when a",
    "non-Mercenary player attacks a Mercenary and the Mercenary defends itself, even when it kills the attacker.",
    "A War Mode Human attacks a High-Risk Human Mercenary in Elwynn Forest, the Mercenary fights back and kills",
    "it. Dodge and parry are zeroed so the Human's first swing lands: an avoided swing records no attacker. The",
    "rule follows who struck first: when the Mercenary strikes a second Human first and that Human fights back,",
    "the Mercenary's next hit still tops Criminal up to 3 minutes."
